# Jak 1: the wrist straps and the fingers on the world (LIST-0.1.1 items 30, 21 and 35; the owner: "accurate body ik
# physics with the wraps on jaks arms ... reacting to the world accurately", "satisfying world collision with finger
# bending to the world"). A new game to Geyser Rock (as jak1_play.sim), then the right hand held out ahead, rolled a
